{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026wDZgSKsV3f1793201864.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>全球廣泛使用的程式語言「PHP」被發現有嚴重保安漏洞。政府稱內部有七百多個系統，有應用「PHP」。</p><p></p><p>「PHP」系統漏洞，會令黑客有機會控制網站，造成敏感信息洩露。創新科技及工業局局長孫東在立法會接受質詢時指，政府各個局和部門共有748個系統，正使用「PHP」，並受到相關影響。</p><p></p><p>現時有逾600個系統已全部完成部署相關安全修補程式，或採取有關風險措施，餘下百多個系統，暫時要求離線或被隔離，並正加緊修補。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T16:40:49.978427+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":201,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T13:47:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T00:58:44.423261+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T16:38:19.749513+00:00","content_hash":"790a75a29deb4dea55ba67095fd59dab54faa912b481b39fbe5e608c19a26baf","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T16:40:49.978427+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}